(7559997, 1211697, 100831, '<td valign="top">This is by far my favorite in the challenge. The longing, the presence vs the timelessness... so perfectly put together IMO. Love the greys, the lines, the perspective and great choice of filter too which in this case, I think, adds.  I can''t give this less than a 10 so 10 it is.</td>', 'This is by far my favorite in the challenge. The longing, the presence vs the timelessness... so perfectly put together IMO. Love the greys, the lines, the perspective and great choice of filter too which in this case, I think, adds.  I can''t give this less than a 10 so 10 it is.', '2018-02-18 23:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
