(7560043, 1211443, 77196, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyStreet:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this. 7 from me as you did a good job with the subject and composition. I''d love to see this in a pure monochrome version, as well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Pure monochrome lost the rainbow, so I went with this.</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyStreet: I like this. 7 from me as you did a good job with the subject and composition. I''d love to see this in a pure monochrome version, as well.  Pure monochrome lost the rainbow, so I went with this.', '2018-02-19 08:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
